    Add DL_CHASE (off): an engaged lineman keys the pull beside him
    
    A down-blocked interior lineman held a shoulder that slid with his
    blocker, and a backside end widened with his; neither reacted to the
    guard pulling next to them. With the flag, a seen puller within reach
    (3 yd; an edge 4.5 yd, only a pull going away from his side) flips his
    shoulder across the blocker's face toward the pull and feeds its motion
    as his flow.
    
